  "title": "Lemon-Garlic Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "These lemony garlic-marinated chicken thighs are easy to prepare requiring just 10 minutes of prep time, an hour for marinating, and 40 minutes in the oven.",
  "authors": [
    "jer"
